Ashlands, Buckmoth, legion fortress, outside~
This place surrounds an Imperial frontier fort of dark stone and square towers
where Legion sentries drill in the yard beneath banners snapping in ash winds.
A road passes guarded gates as distant volcanic smoke stains the northern sky,
while weapons ring on shields across the training ground.~
