#HELPS
1 BUCKMOTH LEGION FORTRESS~
Buckmoth Legion Fort is an old Imperial stronghold south of windswept Ald'ruhn
standing beside the road to Ghostgate beneath smoke from distant Red Mountain.
Stone walls and tall watchtowers enclose a busy courtyard where soldiers drill
and traders, healers and smiths serve the frontier post.~
